# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for .github/workflows/thread-sanitizer.yml.
# Keep each entry narrow and explain it; never suppress game code.

# SDL3_net: NET_Quit runs from atexit and destroys the resolver's mutex while an
# idle resolver thread (SDLNetRslv*) still waits on it. Process shutdown only.
race:SDL_DestroyMutex_REAL
